{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a captivating top-down adventure with <i>Virago: Twisted Reality</i>, the latest installment in the Virago series. Step into the shoes of Willow, a brave little girl navigating a mysterious and perilous world. Explore a vast open world and uncover hidden secrets, all while evading a relentless stalker.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Top-Down Exploration:</strong> Experience the world from a new perspective, reminiscent of beloved classics like <i>Stardew Valley</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open-World Adventure:</strong> Roam freely across diverse landscapes filled with challenges, puzzles, and mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tense Escapes:</strong> Stay one step ahead of a menacing stalker as you unravel the story and fight for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rich Storytelling:</strong> Immerse yourself in a gripping narrative that blends the innocence of childhood with the intensity of suspense.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2846500?t=1743379655","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2846500?t=1743379655","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846500/008388364032e058c6d10226289f644614fd6026/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743379655","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846500/008388364032e058c6d10226289f644614fd6026/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743379655","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a captivating top-down adventure with <i>Virago: Twiste